# ---------------------------------------------------------------- resources a trap releases (D-51)
holdResource is operation
holdResource purpose "Note an open file (kind 1) or a running child process (kind 2) by its operating-system handle, for a trap to release"
holdResource invariant notesResource "\"The resource is in the table until it is let go; the table grows when full\""
